            <p>
                (3) The PageRank vector <m>\vec{x}</m> satisfies the equation
                <m>\vec{x} = G\vec{x}</m>, so <m>\xvec</m> is the steady-state vector of
                this stochastic matrix.
                For the Google matrix, <m>G</m>, for the 3-page example of the
                Internet you considered in #1 and #2, find the steady-state
                vector by solving the equation <m>\vec{x} = G\vec{x}</m> (only using
